week-01-gcp-landing-zone/
├── LAB.md                      reproduction guide: the manual first step, the two IAM grants
├── terraform/
│   ├── main.tf                 four folders, three platform projects
│   └── modules/project-factory/  reused by every later week
├── scripts/                    deploy, validate, and a cleanup that refuses
└── docs/                       references and screenshots

# project-factory/  auto_create_network = false, activate_apis defaults to []
# cleanup.sh        exits 1 without --i-really-mean-it; this week is permanent
